Subject: Service request {{requestNumber}} assigned
<h1>Service request assigned</h1>
<p>{{t "greeting"}} {{assigneeName}},</p>
<p>Service request <strong>{{requestNumber}}</strong> — {{title}} — has been assigned to you.</p>
{{#if actionUrl}}<p style="margin: 20px 0;"><a class="btn" href="{{actionUrl}}">View request</a></p>{{/if}}
